{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yAFnd02Gt01792967474.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>西藏巴青縣再發生地震，但群眾生活暫時未有受到影響。</p><p></p><p>西藏那曲市巴青縣昨晚七時半左右發生5.7級地震，震源深度10公里，是上周發生7級地震以來監測到的最大餘震。這次5.7級地震震感明顯，但並未影響群眾生活及安置工作，災區整體秩序平穩。</p><p></p><p>上星期四發生的7級地震，造成16人死亡、數十人受傷。中共總書記、國家主席習近平早前指示相關部門全力搜救人員，密切監測震情及天氣變化，盡快調撥搶險救援物資，妥善安置災民。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:40.041345+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T22:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:20.533464+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:25.594293+00:00","content_hash":"bd727a221b198a8e5f8a9aa87bc1517a680329e4b05893a92088e1b34842ac9a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:40.041345+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}